<title>CANADA: Dreco completes Vector acquisition.</title>
<headline>Dreco completes Vector acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dreco Energy Services Ltd said on Monday it completed its acquisition of Vector Oil Tool Ltd for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Dreco said the deal, which was announced on November 15, would be effective December 1 and Vector's results would be included with Dreco's from that date.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
